0023: gather batches of region-listed layers (real-time GI work package R-G1). Listed dispatches (patch 0021) adapt their slice sizes apart from full layers: runSliced keeps m_listUnits for them, and the batched gathers of a listed layer count whole gathers (GiListBatch in gi_list_batch.h, which native/remix-bridge/build.cmd copies in from native/remix-bridge/server): kept for a shorter list, cut in proportion for a longer one, dropped at once to what fits after an overrun and grown back by a quarter a submission. Full layers keep their rule. A debug line a listed layer ([Gi] Lamp N gathers: ...) gives the list length, submissions, largest batch and longest submission. test_gi_device mode lots logs at debug level and prints the longest slice a layer (median, p90, layers over 4000 us). Layers are byte-equal to 0021's.
Applies after 0022.
